{
 "layout": "0.2",
 "room": "festival",
 "note": "A realistic touring rig, the size a mid-scale concert actually carries: three trusses at different depths, a row of upstage pars, a floor package, two audience blinders a side and a pair of aerial lasers. Every fixture is placed as a mirrored pair about the centre line, so left and right answer each other by construction rather than by the recipe folding coordinates. Effects: CO2 jets and confetti on the deck and overhead, a video wall upstage, and pyro positions declared but disarmed -- no zone is listed in limits.pyro_zones, so the reader emits them at zero with the reason attached.",
